#: includes/class-abilities.php:105
msgid "Reporting & Analytics"
msgstr "Rapportering & Analys"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:106
msgid ""
"Read-only academy reporting: course/quiz analytics, student rosters, at-risk "
"learners. Instructor-scoped."
msgstr ""
"Skrivskyddad akademirapportering: kurs/quiz-analys, studielistor, "
"risksökande. Instruktörsomfattad."

