msgid ""
"Permanently delete a course and all its sections, lessons, and progress data."
msgstr ""
"Permanent ta bort en kurs och alla dess avsnitt, lektioner och framstegsdata."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:356
msgid "Publish Course"
msgstr "Publicera kurs"

