msgid ""
"Reset all lesson progress and quiz attempts for a student in a course so "
"they can start fresh."
msgstr ""
"Återställ allt lektionsförlopp och quizförsök för en student i en kurs så "
"att de kan börja om."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:889
msgid "Get Enrollment"
msgstr "Hämta registrering"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:890
msgid ""
"Retrieve enrollment details for a specific student and course combination."
msgstr ""
"Hämta registreringsdetaljer för en specifik student- och kurskombination."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:946
msgid "List Enrollments"
msgstr "Lista registreringar"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:947
msgid ""
"List all course enrollments for a student, ordered by most recently enrolled."
msgstr ""
"Lista alla kursregistreringar för en student, sorterad efter senaste "
"registrering."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1002
msgid ""
"Begin a new quiz attempt for the current student, enforcing attempt limits "
"and quiz availability windows."
msgstr ""
"Påbörja ett nytt quizförsök för den aktuella studenten, tillämpa "
"försöksgränser och quiztillgänglighet."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1049 includes/class-template-loader.php:1045
msgid "Submit Quiz"
msgstr "Skicka in quiz"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1050
msgid ""
"Submit a quiz attempt for grading, auto-grading objective questions and "
"flagging essays for manual review."
msgstr ""
"Skicka in ett quizförsök för bedömning, automatisk bedömning av objektiva "
"frågor och flagga uppsatser för manuell granskning."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1085 includes/class-abilities.php:1197
#: includes/class-abilities.php:2274
msgid "Quiz attempt not found."
msgstr "Quizförsök hittades inte."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1104
msgid "Grade Question Response"
msgstr "Bedöm frågesvar"

